    heading: "It is early software",
    body: "superdetermine is under active development. Commands, flags, output formats, and on-disk formats may change between versions, sometimes without a migration path. Pin a version if you need stability.",
  },
  {
    id: "your-data",
    heading: "Your data is yours to look after",
